---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Button from '../components/ui/Button.astro';
import Container from '../components/ui/Container.astro';
import Heading from '../components/ui/Heading.astro';
---

<Layout title='About Me | Rokas'>
  <main id='main' class='w-full pb-24 pt-36 sm:pt-44'>
    <Container size='narrow'>
      <a
        href='/#about'
        class='text-xs font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-muted transition duration-200 hover:text-primary'
        >← Back home</a
      >
      <Heading as='h1' size='display' class='mt-5'>More about me</Heading>
      <div class='mt-6 h-px w-16 bg-accent/60'></div>
      <div class='mt-10 space-y-6 text-base leading-7 text-secondary'>
        <p>
          Hi, my name is Rokas. I'm a self-taught web developer with about 2-3 years of hands-on
          experience in creating web applications. I have been learning programming since high-school
          and also attended "Jaunųjų informatikų akademija" for 2 years. Since the start of my
          programming journey I have been passionate about front-end and that's the career path I'm
          pursuing today.
        </p>
        <p>
          Currently I have the most knowledge with <b class='font-medium text-primary'>React</b> ecosystem
          because of its popularity and job opportunities, although I don't limit myself to just React
          or front-end and planning to try Svelte or Go. My goal in software engineering is not to be a
          "frameworker" that only knows React for example but a true engineer that can solve problems
          in variety of languages, because language is just a tool. <br /> As for my back-end experience
          I have created an <b class='font-medium text-primary'>API</b> with
          <b class='font-medium text-primary'>ASP.NET MVC</b> that performs CRUD operations. In addition,
          I have made an <b class='font-medium text-primary'>Express.js</b> server that handles a
          matchmaking system that I made with <b class='font-medium text-primary'>Socket.io</b>.
        </p>
        <p>
          Along with skills in <b class='font-medium text-primary'>React</b>,
          <b class='font-medium text-primary'>Next</b>, <b class='font-medium text-primary'>Tailwind</b>,
          <b class='font-medium text-primary'>Express</b>, or <b class='font-medium text-primary'>.NET</b>,
          I am very punctual and excel in time management, enabling me to efficiently handle multiple
          projects and meet deadlines. I can adapt to various environments, making me a versatile and
          reliable team member. <br /> I am passionate about the software engineering sphere and always
          look for new things to learn or try out. I am excited to experiment with new technologies or
          frameworks and constantly seek ways to become more efficient and faster in development. For
          instance, I use <b class='font-medium text-primary'>VIM motions</b> to write code faster and
          more efficiently.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div class='mt-12 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-6'>
        <Button href='/CV.pdf' download>Download CV ↓</Button>
        <Button href='/#contact' variant='ghost'>Get in touch →</Button>
      </div>
    </Container>
  </main>
</Layout>
